msgctxt "100"
msgid "(Taichi's calling... Hope everything's okay.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Hello, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Hey, Taichi. Everything all right down there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Oh yeah, everything's fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "So what's with the phone call, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Oh, come on, can't I just give you a call now and then?\r\n"
"It doesn't always have to be for emergencies!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Fair enough. Are you eating okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Geez, you worry too much about us, Uncle Kaz. Of course\r\n"
"I am!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "All right, then. So, what's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Well, I was wondering how long it's gonna be till you come home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I'm not exactly sure. Maybe a few days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Ooh, in that case, can you pick something up for me before you leave "
"Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "That depends on what you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Wellllll, could you get me the newest issue of Five?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Five? You mean Shonen Five?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Yup, that's the one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised you knew what it was, Uncle Kaz. Usually\r\n"
"you're pretty clueless about stuff like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Hey, Shonen Five's pretty mainstream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Anyway, I want you to get me the latest issue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "The one out this week?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Yeah! They're announcing the winners of the Shonen Five Awards in this "
"issue! I'm super pumped!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Hold on. Don't they sell that magazine in Okinawa, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Why don't you buy it yourself? This is the kind of stuff I give you "
"allowance for, Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I can't!"
msgstr "Non posso!"

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "I'm serious! It's out in Tokyo, but it's not out in Okinawa. Not yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Wait, don't you know? They always release stuff later here than on the "
"mainland!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "...Right."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Anyway, I just gotta know what happens next!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "I'll even pay you back when you get here! Please, just get me one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"(...Huh. Looks like I already have a copy. I'll have to give it to him when "
"I get back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"(Guess it wouldn't hurt to swing by a convenience store and take a look.)"
msgstr ""

